      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.4,
          "end": 4.74,
          "en": "Now, with our image added here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.74,
          "end": 6.18,
          "en": "to our Place model",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.18,
          "end": 7.74,
          "en": "and in the provider,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.74,
          "end": 10.14,
          "en": "we can of course also display it on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.14,
          "end": 12.033,
          "en": "For example, in places.list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.02,
          "end": 15.39,
          "en": "There I have this list tile",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.39,
          "end": 17.04,
          "en": "where I output my title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 17.04,
          "end": 20.103,
          "en": "And there I now also wanna display the image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21,
          "end": 24.06,
          "en": "For that, I'll set the leading parameter on ListTile,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.06,
          "end": 26.85,
          "en": "which is one of the built-in parameters that can be set.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 26.85,
          "end": 29.97,
          "en": "And this parameter wants a widget as a value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 29.97,
          "end": 33.81,
          "en": "which will simply be shown at the start of the row.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 33.81,
          "end": 36.81,
          "en": "Now, the widget I do want to display here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.81,
          "end": 40.38,
          "en": "is the CircleAvatar widget,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.38,
          "end": 42.39,
          "en": "which simply renders a circle",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.39,
          "end": 44.493,
          "en": "with some content inside of it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 45.33,
          "end": 48.42,
          "en": "And here we can set the radius of this circle,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.42,
          "end": 50.37,
          "en": "and I'll set it to 26.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 50.37,
          "end": 52.743,
          "en": "Though you can of course play around with that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 53.94,
          "end": 58.5,
          "en": "And I'll set the backgroundImage parameter here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 58.5,
          "end": 60.45,
          "en": "to basically tell Flutter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 60.45,
          "end": 61.95,
          "en": "that inside of this circle,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 61.95,
          "end": 64.56,
          "en": "I wanna have a image in the background.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 64.56,
          "end": 67.47,
          "en": "And I could then also add some foreground content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 67.47,
          "end": 69.87,
          "en": "But in here, I only wanna have an image,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 69.87,
          "end": 71.55,
          "en": "so in the end, it also doesn't matter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 71.55,
          "end": 74.19,
          "en": "whether I set foreground or backgroundImage.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 74.19,
          "end": 76.38,
          "en": "This would only matter if the foreground content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 76.38,
          "end": 78.63,
          "en": "would be transparent, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 78.63,
          "end": 80.23,
          "en": "But here set my backgroundImage.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 81.09,
          "end": 83.58,
          "en": "And this now wants an ImageProvider,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 83.58,
          "end": 85.02,
          "en": "so not a widget,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 85.02,
          "end": 87.24,
          "en": "hence we'll not use image.file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 87.24,
          "end": 89.49,
          "en": "because that would give us a image widget",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 89.49,
          "end": 90.78,
          "en": "and backgroundImage,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 90.78,
          "end": 93.03,
          "en": "instead wants an ImageProvider.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 93.03,
          "end": 95.19,
          "en": "Instead we'll use FileImage,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 95.19,
          "end": 96.75,
          "en": "which sounds similar,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 96.75,
          "end": 99.513,
          "en": "but which is such a ImageProvider.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 100.41,
          "end": 104.16,
          "en": "It extends ImageProvider in the end, as you can see here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 104.16,
          "end": 106.83,
          "en": "And it's this file image, which I'll set here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 106.83,
          "end": 109.08,
          "en": "and the file which I wanna display,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 109.08,
          "end": 110.55,
          "en": "which is this first argument",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 110.55,
          "end": 112.44,
          "en": "wanted by a file image,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 112.44,
          "end": 116.07,
          "en": "is simply that file stored in my place.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 116.07,
          "end": 120.51,
          "en": "So here we can then use places index to get a single place,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 120.51,
          "end": 121.92,
          "en": "and then there the image,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 121.92,
          "end": 123.543,
          "en": "which is such a file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 125.13,
          "end": 128.88,
          "en": "With that, we should be able to add a new place,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 128.88,
          "end": 131.523,
          "en": "give it a title, take a picture,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 132.48,
          "end": 134.22,
          "en": "and click Add Place.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 134.22,
          "end": 136.473,
          "en": "And we see that image here as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 137.57999999999998,
          "end": 140.73,
          "en": "Now, we might want to add some padding around that list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 140.73,
          "end": 144.9,
          "en": "to add more spacing between this top edge of the image",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 144.9,
          "end": 146.57999999999998,
          "en": "and the app bar.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 146.57999999999998,
          "end": 150.99,
          "en": "And for that I'll go to my places.dart file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 150.99,
          "end": 153.88,
          "en": "and wrap my PlacesList here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 155.07,
          "end": 157.59,
          "en": "with a Padding widget",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 157.59,
          "end": 160.563,
          "en": "to add some padding in all directions, maybe eight.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 161.67000000000002,
          "end": 163.473,
          "en": "So now we have that extra spacing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 164.4,
          "end": 165.42000000000002,
          "en": "More importantly,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 165.42000000000002,
          "end": 167.61,
          "en": "I wanna make sure that when we tap this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 167.61,
          "end": 169.44,
          "en": "we're taken to this detail screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 169.44,
          "end": 171.873,
          "en": "where I now wanna display this image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 172.71,
          "end": 174.51,
          "en": "And indeed here my idea",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 174.51,
          "end": 176.25,
          "en": "is to display this image",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 176.25,
          "end": 180.21,
          "en": "as a pretty much full-screen image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 180.21,
          "end": 183.48,
          "en": "And then later, on top of that full-screen image,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 183.48,
          "end": 186.54,
          "en": "I want to display a smaller image",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 186.54,
          "end": 189.72,
          "en": "that shows us the location on a map",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 189.72,
          "end": 193.02,
          "en": "and the address as human readable text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 193.02,
          "end": 196.59,
          "en": "But at the moment, I just wanna have that full-screen image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 196.59,
          "end": 198.78,
          "en": "But since I plan on displaying some content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 198.78,
          "end": 202.47,
          "en": "on top of it later in place_detail.dart,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 202.47,
          "end": 204.78,
          "en": "I will replace this center widget,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 204.78,
          "end": 206.97,
          "en": "which displays the title,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 206.97,
          "end": 208.59,
          "en": "with another widget,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 208.59,
          "end": 211.05,
          "en": "because the title is already shown here in the app bar,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 211.05,
          "end": 214.02,
          "en": "so there's no reason to also show it on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 214.02,
          "end": 215.97,
          "en": "Hence I'll remove it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 215.97,
          "end": 218.43,
          "en": "and replace it with the Stack widget instead.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 218.43,
          "end": 221.7,
          "en": "About which you learned earlier in the course already.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 221.7,
          "end": 224.13,
          "en": "The Stack widget is simply a widget",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 224.13,
          "end": 226.92000000000002,
          "en": "that allows you to display multiple other widgets",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 226.92000000000002,
          "end": 229.82999999999998,
          "en": "so that they are really placed directly above each other,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 229.82999999999998,
          "end": 230.85,
          "en": "on top of each other,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 230.85,
          "end": 233.28,
          "en": "that they overlap each other.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 233.28,
          "end": 235.02,
          "en": "And here on this stack,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 235.02,
          "end": 238.26,
          "en": "we have to set the children parameter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 238.26,
          "end": 239.7,
          "en": "And now add all the widgets",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 239.7,
          "end": 241.68,
          "en": "that should be placed on top of each other,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 241.68,
          "end": 244.62,
          "en": "starting with the bottommost widget.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 244.62,
          "end": 246.87,
          "en": "And that should be this image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 246.87,
          "end": 248.88,
          "en": "So here I'll use Image.file again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 248.88,
          "end": 252.18,
          "en": "because here I wanna display a Image widget.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 252.18,
          "end": 254.13,
          "en": "And the file I wanna use here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 254.13,
          "end": 255.99,
          "en": "is of course my place.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 255.99,
          "end": 258.153,
          "en": "So place.image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 259.35,
          "end": 261.42,
          "en": "And I'll then configure this image",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 261.42,
          "end": 265.5,
          "en": "and set the fit to BoxFit.cover,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 265.5,
          "end": 268.26,
          "en": "and set the width to double infinity",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 268.26,
          "end": 270.78,
          "en": "to take as much space as possible,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 270.78,
          "end": 273.12,
          "en": "and the height to double infinity",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 273.12,
          "end": 275.373,
          "en": "to take as much space as possible.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 277.32,
          "end": 281.25,
          "en": "If I do that, I do see this image here full screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 281.25,
          "end": 282.78,
          "en": "below the app bar.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 282.78,
          "end": 283.98,
          "en": "And as mentioned later,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 283.98,
          "end": 286.053,
          "en": "we'll put some content on top of that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 287.31,
          "end": 288.96,
          "en": "But for the moment, that's it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 288.96,
          "end": 292.323,
          "en": "and we're now ready to move on to pick a location.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
